(3, 'QT/028/2019-20', 2, '2021-07-16', 5, 4, 2, 'INQ/036/2019-20', 0, '2021-07-16', '0', NULL, '118.00', '', '', 68, '0', '<p><strong>Dear Sir,</strong><br />\r\nThank you for your interest in our LD PE Washing Line. Please find herewith the quotation of 150 KG kg/ hr with the best competitive rates for your kind perusal and consideration to place your valued order to us.<br />\r\nYou fully feel free to contact us for any information you required. We will always remain to support you for the best guidelines in our business.</p>\r\nÂ \r\n\r\n<p><strong>Contents</strong></p>\r\nÂ \r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><strong>Design Basis</strong>\r\n\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Capacity</li>\r\n		<li>About Input Material</li>\r\n		<li>Quality Criteria Of Final Product</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Process Description</strong>\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Functional Section And Machinery</li>\r\n		<li>Process Flow Chat</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Utility & Auxiliary Requirement</strong>\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Design Basis</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', '<p>We hope our offer meets your requirements fulfilled. We look forward for your valuable order of confirmation.</p>\r\n', 0, '<p>Utility & Auxiliary requirement:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Floor space: We will provide engineering service to design a plant lay-out to fit with existing customerâ€™s building. Several options are available thank to the modular design of plants. Indicative requirements are:\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Production Area Surface: 3000 Sq. Ft. Machines requires floor space (60 ft. (L) X 50 Ft. (W)) Line Installed either in â€˜Câ€™ or â€˜Lâ€™ Format.</li>\r\n		<li>Dimension of Area: To be defined according to production line layout</li>\r\n		<li>Net Height (Shed): 20 Ft.</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>Electric Power:\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Consumption: 55 HP 41 KW per 150 kg LD PE</li>\r\n		<li>Installed Power: LT Connection</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>Process Industrial Water:\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Consumption: Approx. 5000 Lt per day of LD PE</li>\r\n		<li>Processing.</li>\r\n		<li>Specification: The water must be clear, transparent without suspend material, PH value closed to 7.</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Suggested Labor Requirement:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="164">\r\n			<p><b>Position</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="171">\r\n			<p><b>Suggested </b><b>No.</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="273">\r\n			<p><b>Job Description</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="164">\r\n			<p>Skilled Operator</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Unskilled Operator</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="171">\r\n			<p style="text-align: center;">2</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="273">\r\n			<p>To Be Responsible For Everything. Decide The Quality Inspection Procedure And Grade Of End Product. Execute Product Sampling And Inspect The Product.</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan="3" valign="top" width="607">\r\n			<p><b>Maintenance</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="164">\r\n			<p>Mechanic</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="171">\r\n			<p align="center">1</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="273">\r\n			<p>Maintain Every Mechanical Work Of The Plant.</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan="3" valign="top" width="607">\r\n			<p><b>Following Labor Requirement </b><b>Is For Every Shift</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan="3" valign="top" width="607">\r\n			<p><b>Operator</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="164">\r\n			<p>Feeding Station</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="171">\r\n			<p align="center">3</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="273">\r\n			<p>Cut Wires Of Bottle Bale And Clean Out Of Feeding Area.</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="164">\r\n			<p>Sorting Station</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="171">\r\n			<p align="center">4</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="273">\r\n			<p>Remove Every Contamination Mixed With Bottles.</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="164">\r\n			<p>Packing Station</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="171">\r\n			<p align="center">3</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="273">\r\n			<p>Exchange Packing Bag And Record The Weight Of Bag.</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\nÂ \r\n\r\n<p>The Sorting Station Person No. Should Be Adjusted According To The Raw Material Quality And The Efficiency Of The Staff.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Responsibility Scope Between Supplier & Buyer:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="416">\r\n			<p><b>SUPPLY AT</b><b>CHARGE</b><b>OF</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="97">\r\n			<p align="center"><b>SUPPLIER</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="89">\r\n			<p align="center"><b>BUYER</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td colspan="3" valign="top" width="601">\r\n			<p><b>Engineering</b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="416">\r\n			<p>Project ManagementÂ  Within The Scope Of Supply</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="97">\r\n			<p align="center">Â·</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="89">\r\n			<p align="center">Â </p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="416">\r\n			<p>Process Engineering According To Process Data And Design Basis</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="97">\r\n			<p align="center">Â·</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="89">\r\n			<p align="center"><b>Â </b></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td valign="top" width="416">\r\n			<p>Architectural And Structural Engineering For Buildings And Found